{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 38,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55860900878906,
        42.276031494140625,
        399.6013488769531,
        51.276031494140625
      ],
      "text": "evaluation and for receiving isoniazid preventive treatment, knowledge",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.47761535644531,
        54.273040771484375,
        399.78179931640625,
        63.273040771484375
      ],
      "text": "of the HIV status of contacts is important. If HIV testing cannot be done,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.20761108398438,
        66.27005004882812,
        399.3222351074219,
        75.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "epidemiological risk factors and clinical features suggesting HIV",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.1986083984375,
        78.26705932617188,
        300.6825256347656,
        87.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "infection should be sought in the evaluation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.20761108398438,
        96.26705932617188,
        399.412841796875,
        105.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "People with other immunocompromising conditions, such as leukaemia",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.28860473632812,
        108.26406860351562,
        399.52972412109375,
        117.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "or lymphoma, or who are receiving immunosuppressive therapy such",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.3966064453125,
        118.15670776367188,
        399.72479248046875,
        129.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "α as high-dose corticosteroids or TNF  inhibitors, are also a high priority",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.59197998046875,
        132.27304077148438,
        305.4769287109375,
        141.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "for evaluation and appropriate treatment (37).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.60098266601562,
        162.27005004882812,
        163.8079833984375,
        171.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "Remark 4",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55860900878906,
        174.27603149414062,
        399.67340087890625,
        183.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Because of the potential severity of MDR-TB and XDR-TB, contacts of all",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.54960632324219,
        186.27304077148438,
        399.6465148925781,
        195.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "cases of proven or suspected pulmonary MDR-TB or XDR-TB should be",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.52261352539062,
        198.27005004882812,
        399.4397888183594,
        207.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "given high priority for investigation, regardless of the index patient’s",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.30661010742188,
        210.26705932617188,
        399.7188415527344,
        219.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "sputum smear result. Contacts of known or suspected MDR-TB and XDR-",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.08160400390625,
        222.26406860351562,
        399.04345703125,
        231.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "TB cases should be evaluated as described for contacts of drug-sensitive",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        126.91960144042969,
        234.26107788085938,
        399.7004089355469,
        243.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "cases but with greater urgency because of the potential consequences",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56741333007812,
        246.27294921875,
        399.7091979980469,
        255.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "of TB should it develop. One of the factors thought to contribute to the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.58541870117188,
        258.26995849609375,
        399.59259033203125,
        267.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "emergence of MDR-TB and XDR-TB is transmission of the responsible",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.46841430664062,
        270.2669677734375,
        400.2309875488281,
        279.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "organisms in communities. Studies indicate that close contacts of MDR-",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.58541870117188,
        282.26397705078125,
        399.709228515625,
        291.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "TB patients who develop active TB usually have drug-resistant disease",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.58541870117188,
        294.260986328125,
        399.7180480957031,
        303.260986328125
      ],
      "text": "(38,39). Systematic investigation of contacts of known or suspected",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.59442138671875,
        306.25799560546875,
        399.6769104003906,
        315.2760009765625
      ],
      "text": "cases of MDR-TB and XDR-TB may be an effective means of halting the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55302429199219,
        318.27276611328125,
        399.667724609375,
        327.27276611328125
      ],
      "text": "transmission of drug-resistant strains of TB in a community, although",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.53501892089844,
        330.269775390625,
        399.6676940917969,
        339.269775390625
      ],
      "text": "this is not yet proven. In addition, when treatment is available, early",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.53501892089844,
        342.26678466796875,
        399.6769714355469,
        351.26678466796875
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis may reduce the severity of illness and the likelihood of dying.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.54402160644531,
        372.2637939453125,
        163.11203002929688,
        381.2637939453125
      ],
      "text": "Remark 5",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55860900878906,
        384.27606201171875,
        399.64617919921875,
        393.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "The aim of the initial contact evaluation is to identify active TB (also",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.52261352539062,
        396.2730712890625,
        399.8172912597656,
        405.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "called co-prevalent cases) and also contacts who were recently infected,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.24360656738281,
        408.27008056640625,
        399.40338134765625,
        417.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "Because the risk for developing TB is increased for 1–2 years after",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.27960205078125,
        420.26708984375,
        399.4305419921875,
        429.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "infection, all contacts should be informed about the increased risk and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.30659484863281,
        432.26409912109375,
        399.58343505859375,
        441.26409912109375
      ],
      "text": "about the symptoms that could indicate TB. The index case, particularly",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.45059204101562,
        444.2610778808594,
        399.7452697753906,
        453.2790832519531
      ],
      "text": "if he or she is a family member, should also be instructed about possible",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.62161254882812,
        456.27294921875,
        399.8036193847656,
        465.2760925292969
      ],
      "text": "indicators of TB in contacts and about the need for prompt evaluation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.67068481445312,
        468.2699279785156,
        399.72283935546875,
        477.2699279785156
      ],
      "text": "if any of these indicators develops. TB control programmes may consider",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.58969116210938,
        480.2669372558594,
        399.731689453125,
        489.2669372558594
      ],
      "text": "follow-up screening, particularly in the ﬁrst year after exposure (such",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.59869384765625,
        492.2639465332031,
        322.05267333984375,
        501.2639465332031
      ],
      "text": "as after 6 or 12 months), to identify incident cases.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.56669235229492,
        522.0902099609375,
        399.84832763671875,
        531.2609252929688
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 4 In settings of high HIV prevalence it is recommended that all household",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.72470092773438,
        534.2579345703125,
        329.62237548828125,
        543.2759399414062
      ],
      "text": "and close contacts be counselled and tested for HIV.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.59939575195312,
        552.2741088867188,
        324.8073425292969,
        561.2741088867188
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57240295410156,
        582.2800903320312,
        156.96641540527344,
        591.2800903320312
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55860900878906,
        594.2760620117188,
        399.6195068359375,
        603.2760620117188
      ],
      "text": "Because PLHIV who are exposed to a person with infectious TB are at",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.62161254882812,
        606.2730712890625,
        399.7545166015625,
        615.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "high risk for developing active TB, they should be managed differently",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.62161254882812,
        618.2700805664062,
        399.664306640625,
        627.2700805664062
      ],
      "text": "from contacts who do not have HIV infection, with regard to evaluation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        217.19430541992188,
        651.97265625,
        225.00930786132812,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "36",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}